; The joint gizmo shapes, the one variable no other golden moves: a PinJoint3D draws a cross and a
; ConeTwistJoint3D a swing cone and twist spiral toward each body, for every node and faint while
; unselected (ADR-0056). Each joint has two bodies away from it and not straight above or below it. The
; cone has non-default spans. No other scene shows a regression in a gizmo shape, since only a golden
; with `gizmos: true` draws one.
